{"reviews":[{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-0","r":2.0,"t":"My Hair was snowing....","x":"At first you think it works but not even 24hours later the white flakes start to come about.... I wasted my money but we all take L\u2019s sometimes!","h":63,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-1","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"this gel flaked on me. it's snowing in April","h":59,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-2","r":1.0,"t":"Not for 4C hair","x":"This did not work with my 4C hair. I used it for a wash and go. My hair shrunk up 80% and left me looking ridiculous.","h":56,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-3","r":5.0,"t":"... hair community but for me this has been the best one. The key for me is whether my ...","x":"I have tried almost every hair gel that's popular in the natural hair community but for me this has been the best one.  The key for me is whether my hair is dry the next day but not with this gel.  Curls are popping, moisturized and seems to last all day.","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-4","r":1.0,"t":"Trash...Period","x":"In less you buy the products to pair with this gel it\u2019s trash. The end","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-5","r":4.0,"t":"I like the promises on the bottle about Biotin so I\u2019m ...","x":"I\u2019m not sure how I feel about this gel yet. I bought it to replace Eco styler gel and from what I can tell it\u2019s very similar to it. I have 4C low porosity hair and I find that gels make my hair crispy and prone to breakage. I feel I need to wash this gel out everyday to prevent buildup. I like the promises on the bottle about Biotin so I\u2019m sticking with it for now.","h":9,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-6","r":4.0,"t":"Great gel","x":"A little Gel goes a long way. Don\u2019t use to much it will cake up and turn white. You don\u2019t need much.The scent is very light.This is amazing and I hate using gel but this one works so well I can\u2019t put it down.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-7","r":4.0,"t":"Good alternative","x":"I like it.  Holds firmly without making your hair too \u201ccrunchy.\u201d  Decent alternative to eco-styler when you want your hair a bit more moisturized.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-8","r":4.0,"t":"Might just be a keeper","x":"I didn't buy this product from Amazon but I had to leave a review.  I've been struggling to get the right gel that defines my natural curls after a well known company discontinued theirs.  I grabbed this one thinking it's going in my every growing stock pile of products I've gotten but I thick this is a keeper.  I loved that it gives my curls nice definition without being overbearing crunchy.  The smell is not that strong,  not overwhelming.  I held on to three last star on this review until I t","h":6,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Best Gel Ever! Soft Curls!","x":"This is the best gel I've ever used. Gives me the same result as Eco without the hard and crunchy curls! I have 4c hair and I love all this so much! I've only used it a week so I'm not sure if it's helping with growth but I'm excited to try more Mane Choice products. Each one I've used so far has done wonders. I only experienced flakes when I used too much of another product along with this gel.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-10","r":1.0,"t":"I was so excited about this product ...until....","x":"The flakey residue is unbelievable.  I spent hours twisting my wash n go only to have to wash it out the next night. This photo is from taking down only 3 twists.  This would be a great product if not for that.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-11","r":1.0,"t":"Spilled during delivery","x":"Spilled during delivery. I love this gel but I wish they would find a way to make it more secure during travel.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-12","r":1.0,"t":"Did not like at all !","x":"This left white flakes in my daughters hair and this made her hair so dull and dry looking so disappointed.  My daughter is African American with 4a/4b hair. this is on of the worse products we have every tried on her hair.","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-13","r":4.0,"t":"Smoother look with curls","x":"This is the first time I used this project and my curls really look good.  Normally they are more frizzy.  I\u2019ll have to see what it does second day.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-14","r":3.0,"t":"Flakes next day","x":"Does a great job defining my curls but the next day my hair was very flaky. It got worse the day after.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-15","r":2.0,"t":"Product, almost good...Not quite!","x":"I just purchased this product a few weeks ago. I loved how it defined my curly hair. However, I don't like how it made my hair shrink and started flaking :(. Unfortunately, I returned the product back to Amazon for my refund. I think I will just stick to my Eco Styler Black Castor Flaxseed Gel :).","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-16","r":2.0,"t":"no holding power","x":"I did not get the type of hold I was expecting with this product.  I stopped using it.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-17","r":5.0,"t":"It does what it states it does","x":"Great product that really works. Will be purchasing more in the near future.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-18","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"This doesnt hold my hair down. Its worthless for me.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-19","r":3.0,"t":"Makes the hair flakes","x":"Makes the hair flakes is good but the only problem.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-20","r":5.0,"t":"Do not apply like regular gel","x":"Everyone who is having problems with flaking is either caking it on wasting product or applying to completely dry hair. With this gel waaaaaaay less is a whole lot! I dip 2-3 fingers in and thats good for my whole 7 year olds butt length hair head. It needs damp to wet hair to activate then next day/subsequent dzy hair again needs to be water reactivated (it's literally on the directions if you aren't sure).  I never write reviews but this one definitely needed clarification. It works on 4c hair","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-21","r":1.0,"t":"Left dry and flaky","x":"I usually love the Mane Choice products, but I was shocked to discover that it produces major flakes and makes your hair look disgusting! I only applied a little bit to a very small section of my hair to see how the hold would be before applying it all over. Just a few hours later it looked as if I had been scratching and had dandruff. Trust me, please avoid this gel.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-22","r":1.0,"t":"Couldn\u2019t get past the texture","x":"I bought this product looking for a healthier gel than ecostyler. But I couldn\u2019t get past the consistency. Too sticky and it left a residue on my edges which is the only part of my hair I used it on. No one wants to wash, deep condition and then have to wash again because their gel has made their hair sticky and created buildup. :-(","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-23","r":2.0,"t":"Good curl but FLAKES!!","x":"I have tried several gels for my natural hair and although this gives the curl definition I like - it flakes!! So at the end of the day, i look like i have dandruff for the amount of dry gel on my shirts. I will use out the rest of the jar then that's it's for me.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B0753JSKQZ-24","r":5.0,"t":"So Far So Good","x":"So far I love this product. It was recommended to me as part of my \"Curly Girl Method' routine. Doesn't leave my hair crunchy which I was somewhat worried about at first. I use it with a couple DevaCurl products as well. So far they work well together.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers report white flakes or residue, often appearing the next day or when too much product is used.","cites":[1,2,7,11,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say it defines curls well and leaves hair moisturized without being hard or crunchy.","cites":[4,8,10,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers with 4C hair report it did not work for them, causing shrinkage or crispness.","cites":[3,6]},{"text":"A few reviewers describe it as a good alternative to Eco Styler gel.","cites":[6,8,10]},{"text":"One reviewer reports the product spilled during delivery.","cites":[12]}]},"qa":[]}